 ## Bootstrap sequence
 
 1. One-time state bucket (chicken-and-egg — Terraform can't create the
    bucket it stores its own state in):
    ```sh
-   gcloud storage buckets create gs://remiges-trade-tfstate \
-     --project=remiges-trade --location=asia-southeast2 \
